{"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL17MXLAccidentalMarkV4fontAA7MXLFontVvp","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"font","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"font"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLFontV","text":"MXLFont"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The font attribute group gathers together attributes for determining the font within a credit or direction."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They are based on the text styles for Cascading Style Sheets. The font-family is a comma-separated list of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"font names.The font-style can be normal or italic. The font-size can be one of the CSS sizes or a numeric","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point size. The font-weight can be normal or bold. The default is application-dependent, but is a text font","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vs. a music font.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalMark"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"font","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFont","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLFontV","text":"MXLFont"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalMark\/font","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentalmark\/font"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMX